# D3-TH-004: A wax surrogate is not a chemically pure phase-change standard
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 paraffin 5g @ 20C
add v2 hexadecane 5g @ 20C
measure v1 melting_point
measure v2 melting_point
heat v1 0.5kJ
heat v2 0.5kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
cool v1 0.5kJ
cool v2 0.5kJ
look v1
look v2
inspect
